<ans># Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd — Q1FY26 Financial Data (Quarter Ended 30 June 2025)

## Data Availability Summary

Attempts were made to access the primary requested source — the company's public-disclosure page at `adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/about-us/financials` — but this page currently returns a **404 "Page Does Not Exist"** error. Additionally, the only IRDAI "NL" public-disclosure PDF discoverable at the company's legacy asset path is dated for the quarter ended **31 December 2016**, which is a stale filing and cannot be used for Q1FY26 without violating period-integrity.

As a result, statutory NL-1 (Revenue Account), NL-2 (Expense schedule), and Balance Sheet figures for Q1FY26 could not be sourced and verified. The only live, dated, verifiable Q1FY26 figures come from the **Aditya Birla Capital consolidated Q1 FY26 press release (3 August 2025)**, corroborated by an **ICICI Direct research note** summarizing the same release. Per the task rules, all line items without a verifiable, correctly-dated Q1FY26 source have been left blank rather than estimated.

## Q1FY26 Results Table

| company | period | line_item | basis | value | unit | source_name | source_url | filing_date |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd | Q1FY26 | Total GWP | IGAAP | **1357** | INR_crore | Aditya Birla Capital Q1 FY26 Press Release | https://www.adityabirla.com/media/press-releases/aditya-birla-capital-q1-fy26-financial-results-consolidated-pat-and-revenues-up-10/ | 2025-08-03 |
| Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd | Q1FY26 | Combined ratio | IGAAP | **111** | % | Aditya Birla Capital Q1 FY26 Press Release | https://www.adityabirla.com/media/press-releases/aditya-birla-capital-q1-fy26-financial-results-consolidated-pat-and-revenues-up-10/ | 2025-08-03 |
| Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd | Q1FY26 | Retail health market share | — | **14.5** | % | Aditya Birla Capital Q1 FY26 Press Release (SAHI market share) | https://www.adityabirla.com/media/press-releases/aditya-birla-capital-q1-fy26-financial-results-consolidated-pat-and-revenues-up-10/ | 2025-08-03 |

**Note:** Retail health GWP, Net Written Premium (NWP), Net Earned Premium (NEP), PAT (IGAAP/IFRS), Claims ratio (IGAAP/IFRS), Expense ratio, Expense of Management (EoM) ratio, Commission ratio, Solvency ratio, Net worth, Assets Under Management (AUM), and Investment yield are **not populated** — these figures were not published in any verifiable, correctly-dated Q1FY26 source located during this research.

## Key Findings

- **Total GWP** grew **30% YoY** to **Rs. 1,357 crore** for Q1FY26, per the consolidated press release.
- **Combined ratio** improved to **111%** in Q1FY26, versus **112%** in the year-ago quarter — a modest year-on-year improvement in underwriting efficiency.
- **Standalone Health Insurer (SAHI) market share** rose by **200 bps YoY** to **14.5%**, indicating continued share gains in the standalone health insurance segment.
- The ICICI Direct research note independently corroborates the GWP growth and combined ratio figures but does not add incremental statutory detail (NWP, NEP, EoM ratio, Net worth, PAT, solvency, AUM, or investment yield).

## Audit Notes & Caveats

- The **primary requested source** (`adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/about-us/financials`) is currently inaccessible (404 error) and does not host live Q1FY26 IRDAI NL disclosures.
- The only "public-disclosure.pdf" discoverable at the company's legacy asset path is dated for the **quarter ended 31 December 2016** — a stale filing, not Q1FY26 (30 June 2025). Its figures were **not used** to avoid mismatched-period contamination.
- The GWP figure of Rs. 1,357 crore is **not explicitly specified** as being on a 1/n (statutory) basis versus an ex-1/n basis in the press release; it should be treated as indicative pending statutory confirmation.
- All statutory IGAAP line items (NWP, NEP, EoM ratio, Net worth, Solvency ratio, PAT-IGAAP, Claims/Expense/Commission ratios, AUM, Investment yield) require the company's actual IRDAI NL-1/NL-2/Balance Sheet quarterly disclosure PDF for Q1FY26, which could not be located despite multiple targeted searches.

## Recommendation

To complete the statutory data points (NWP, NEP, EoM ratio, Net worth, Investments/AUM, Solvency ratio, PAT-IGAAP, and the Claims/Expense/Commission ratios), I'd suggest:

1. Checking the **IRDAI portal directly** (irdai.gov.in) under the "Public Disclosures" section for Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd's Q1FY26 (quarter ended 30 June 2025) NL return filings.
2. Contacting Aditya Birla Health Insurance's investor relations team directly, as their public disclosure page currently returns a 404 error — the correct live path may have changed (e.g., to a `/downloads` or `/investor-relations` subpage).
3. If a broader date range is acceptable, checking whether the **FY25 Annual Report** (covering the year ended 31 March 2025) has been published, as it may include a Q4FY25 comparative that could help contextualize Q1FY26 once the correct disclosure is located.</ans>
